ut,Earthenware","url":"https://newportmansions.rediscoverysoftware.com/mDetail.aspx?rID=10418&db=objects&dir=NEWPHIST","imageUrl":"data/chateau/images/chateau-psnc-11552.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Dining Room","floor":"1"},{"id":"chateau-habs-144787","title":"The Dining Room, from the west","artist":"Jack E. Boucher (photograph, 1969)","date":"1969","year":1969,"url":"https://www.loc.gov/item/ri0341/","imageUrl":"data/chateau/images/chateau-habs-144787.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Dining Room","floor":"1"},{"id":"chateau-habs-144788","title":"The Dining Room overmantel","artist":"Jack E. Boucher (photograph, 1969)","date":"1969","year":1969,"url":"https://www.loc.gov/item/ri0341/","imageUrl":"data/chateau/images/chateau-habs-144788.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Dining Room","floor":"1"},{"id":"chateau-habs-144789","title":"The Green Parlor, looking west from the Ballroom","artist":"Jack E. Boucher (photograph, 1969)","date":"1969","year":1969,"url":"https://www.loc.gov/item/ri0341/","imageUrl":"data/chateau/images/chateau-habs-144789.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Green Parlor","floor":"1"},{"id":"chateau-psnc-11550","title":"Tile Fireplace Surround","artist":"Minton","date":"1876","year":1876,"medium":"Glazed Earthenware","url":"https://newportmansions.rediscoverysoftware.com/mDetail.aspx?rID=10417&db=objects&dir=NEWPHIST","imageUrl":"data/chateau/images/chateau-psnc-11550.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Library","floor":"1"},{"id":"chateau-psnc-12475","title":"Italian Renaissance Style Library Table","artist":"Luigi Frullini","date":"c. 1876","year":1876,"medium":"Walnut","url":"https://newportmansions.rediscoverysoftware.com/mDetail.aspx?rID=13585&db=objects&dir=NEWPHIST","imageUrl":"data/chateau/images/chateau-psnc-12475.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"Library","floor":"1"},{"id":"chateau-habs-144784","title":"The Library, from the west","artist":"Jack E. Boucher (photograph, 1969)","date":"1969","year":1969,"url":"https://www.loc.gov/item/ri0341/","imageUrl":"da